## 7. Playing the Ball, Passive Play

### Playing the Ball

It is ***permitted*** to:

1. throw, catch, stop, push or hit the ball, by using <u>hands</u> (open or closed), <u>arms, head, torso, thighs, and knees</u>;

2. <u>hold</u> the ball for a maximum of <u>3 seconds</u>, also when it is lying on the floor (13:1a);

